<title>UK: Toyota Finance sets A$200 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Toyota Finance sets A$200 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA FINANCE AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$200 MLN     COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    18.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
